Subject: Re: measEq.syntax (Wu&Estabrook) for binary items
Message-ID: <ktqUbpNRRfU.HCaIZ1LNCQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <ktqUbpNRRfU.n3Qx6AqaAwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
